Thermodynamics and heat transfer (@thermodynamics-and-heat-transfer: 0, is #chapter, #thermodynamics-and-heat-transfer "foundations/Read-thermodynamics-and-heat-transfer-from-zero.lingua#r_4S4VF8JVHQEF1PJ5G3HEQWG8DF", #thermodynamics-and-heat-transfer "study/Whole-books-graduate-courses-and-a-sustained-thermal-programme.lingua#r_7NHTEAK764F0WSPPZNHZB7CJ1M") { r_6KQBZNJM6WNV9A69R3DZY1NH7E
Begin with [Read thermodynamics and heat transfer from zero](foundations/Read-thermodynamics-and-heat-transfer-from-zero.lingua#r_4S4VF8JVHQEF1PJ5G3HEQWG8DF). Follow energy through familiar objects, then learn the language, mathematics and evidence needed to explain temperature, work, heat, equilibrium and transport. The progression reaches complete classical theory, thermal machines, spatial/transient transfer, measurements and advanced microscopic and research questions.

[Whole books, graduate courses and a sustained thermal programme](study/Whole-books-graduate-courses-and-a-sustained-thermal-programme.lingua#r_7NHTEAK764F0WSPPZNHZB7CJ1M) describes the sustained whole-book/course study and demanding later work. Shared quantitative, chemistry, measurement, computation and electromagnetic Records appear at their point of use; each has a separate thermal continuation. A reference to another field is an invitation to the relevant knowledge, not a requirement to complete that entire subject first.

The main reading develops through these connected sections:

**Systems, language and measurement:** [Read thermodynamics and heat transfer from zero](foundations/Read-thermodynamics-and-heat-transfer-from-zero.lingua#r_4S4VF8JVHQEF1PJ5G3HEQWG8DF) · [A thermal service and its physical system](foundations/A-thermal-service-and-its-physical-system.lingua#r_13ETYNBXH6JKRVHB3H5KR4QH5Z) · [Systems, boundaries and thermal vocabulary](foundations/Systems-boundaries-state-and-thermal-vocabulary.lingua#r_438839TWPYKN6MTK1CCNG2JBCF) · [Absolute temperature, units and reference levels](foundations/Absolute-temperature-units-and-reference-levels.lingua#r_36PSQZ15KGX9RBTGGBV1G7Q06S) · [Equilibrium, state variables and local description](foundations/Equilibrium-state-variables-and-local-description.lingua#r_7ZE016Z66H53QB69W5F3HVEN5X) · [Temperature response, contact and calibration](measurement/Temperature-response-contact-and-calibration.lingua#r_4R7759MYCC3X3GBCZ5GRSN188W) · [Energy, power, heat and useful work](foundations/Energy-power-heat-and-useful-work.lingua#r_5AGSBC6PR9H1ZGAE3B88568ZDQ) · [Heat and work signs across physics and chemistry](foundations/Heat-and-work-signs-across-physics-and-chemistry.lingua#r_3Z4G73ZME2A7M1A63NGX177SQN).

**Properties and energy balances:** [Closed-system energy and storage](balances/Closed-system-energy-and-storage.lingua#r_26CN1Z2H23NCXB8W7K74CVW5VN) · [Boundary work, quasistatic paths and irreversibility](balances/Boundary-work-quasistatic-paths-and-irreversibility.lingua#r_3FJYGFE1APRF36P7GC0QZYCW0P) · [Equations of state and caloric information](properties/Equations-of-state-and-caloric-information.lingua#r_3YYAN5FQJXPX2441B2ZK5M4VPN) · [Property tables, reference states and interpolation](properties/Property-tables-reference-states-and-interpolation.lingua#r_3FSQXM2G05B0C35PEQ6G67M5BZ) · [Quality, latent energy and two-phase properties](properties/Quality-latent-energy-and-two-phase-properties.lingua#r_12PVBRDY4725K5W1XTVQFDZRFX) · [Control-volume mass and energy balances](balances/Control-volume-mass-and-energy-balances.lingua#r_3GJ7MNPFS8HECS4WPV8WZCEY2M) · [Turbines, compressors, valves, mixers and nozzles](balances/Turbines-compressors-valves-mixers-and-nozzles.lingua#r_5FNNDS9HS3F0FDBD0MX1H5D8YJ) · [Heat capacity, temperature dependence and calorimetry](properties/Heat-capacity-temperature-dependence-and-calorimetry.lingua#r_03R86BMA4QVQGH84GXHZZDNJKZ) · [Calculus, fields and differential equations for thermal models](foundations/Calculus-fields-differential-equations-and-solving-a-thermal-model.lingua#r_5BYXE3KKKGPFBR1BGCVY7ZABNG) · [Exact differentials, partial derivatives and thermal models](mathematics/Exact-differentials-partial-derivatives-and-thermal-models.lingua#r_58NJQNAS8V4TVM3FAKB7HAK9QP).

