[Thermodynamics and heat transfer sources](Sources.lingua#r_4N96T70VYW3C3M91M2SXF5KEQF) holds the externally referenced books, courses, primary methods and research. Inline programs are small original teaching examples with bounded assumptions; they do not supply a general equipment-design package. Physical completion requires evidence of physical work, while documentary and computational achievements retain their own scope.

Continue through [Physics — fields, matter, motion and physical evidence](../Physics.lingua#r_04A5CP8RTBERZEN4XCCDQ3T47W), [Engineering — systems, design, construction, and operation](../../engineering/Engineering.lingua#r_5DA6VY09MAD2N8D9SH0FFJVV68), [General chemistry](../../chemistry/general-chemistry/General-chemistry.lingua#r_206GS6CVXD8WSY1VX7PRF7136V), [Industrial chemistry — chemical transformations, useful products and continuing production](../../chemistry/industrial-chemistry/Industrial-chemistry.lingua#r_3AKBAFB2ABJ0671QW6ZBQ0B618), [Metals and metallurgical production — feed, refining, structure, useful products, and recovery](../../materials/metals-and-metallurgical-production/Metals-and-metallurgical-production.lingua#r_59BDAQXT81552YF5F8TH4KQQH1) or [Electrical power engineering — sources, networks, machines and continuing service](../../engineering/electrical-power-engineering/Electrical-power-engineering.lingua#r_300EPNGATK7PHWNZCQFBXGZFCQ) as the subject requires. Broader entrances are [Ergon — mathematics, science, and engineering](../../Hephaestus.lingua#r_00000000000000000000002001), [Inquiry — shared ways to understand and investigate](../../inquiry/Inquiry.lingua#r_75MNKZQKNB0XBG021SWWW2HASB), [Hephaestus](../../Hephaestus.lingua#r_00000000000000000000002001) and [Philosophy](../../../../scholazein/philosophy/Philosophy.lingua#r_00000000000000000000001001). Thermal/energy engineering, refrigeration, fluids, statistical physics and semiconductor manufacturing keep their own full specialist scope.

**Continue:** [Read thermodynamics and heat transfer from zero](foundations/Read-thermodynamics-and-heat-transfer-from-zero.lingua#r_4S4VF8JVHQEF1PJ5G3HEQWG8DF) · [Whole books, graduate courses and a sustained thermal programme](study/Whole-books-graduate-courses-and-a-sustained-thermal-programme.lingua#r_7NHTEAK764F0WSPPZNHZB7CJ1M).
